 Note 1: If input 0, then properties of all CPs will be outputted to CPprop.txt in current folder (and if you feel the output speed is slow, you can input -1 to avoid outputting ESP, which is the most expensive one)
 Note 2: If input CP index with "d" suffix, e.g. 17d, then property of this CP can be decomposed into orbital contribution
